    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d468">

                <pb facs="0477" n="465" sameAs="frus:frus1945v04/pg465"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">860F.01/6–2945: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Czechoslovakia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Klieforth</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Praha</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-06-29T12:00:00+02:00">June 29,
                            1945—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received July 1—12:17 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>46. President Beneš told me today with great joy that unexpectedly all Russian
                    troops would leave city of Prague by July 3 and implied <pb facs="0478" n="466"
                        xml:id="pg466"/> that my incident was one of contributing factors. He said
                    that the Russian forces in entire country would be reduced substantially. He was
                    unable however to learn date of final departure of entire Russian Army of
                    occupation. I am of the opinion that a token reduction of our forces in American
                    Zone would be appreciated by the President in view of Russian evacuation of
                    Praha.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . .</p>
                <p>Sent Dept as 46; rptd to Moscow as 11.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Klieforth</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
